WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.510
My Pendulum Zones are set with 
Scale 2 Acrobatic Magician

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:07.950
and Scale 8 Nirvana High Paladin.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:12.420
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 3 and 7 simultaneously!

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.390
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.360
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.010
Pendulum Summon!

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.450
Appear, my monsters!

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.090
Five monsters at once?

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.740
I'm fighting with everyone!

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.590
D-Wheels.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.770
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.470
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:02.940
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:05.080
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.010
To a Single Road

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.430
Dad... Mom.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:02.630
I activate my spell card Smile 
World from my hand!

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:07.580
The attack points of all monsters on the field

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.420
increase by 100 times their total 
number, until the end of my turn.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.200
I currently have six monsters.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.410
Thus, an increase of 600 for each!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:21.350
And I activate the 1100-attack-point 
Radish Horse's effect!

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.640
Until the end of my turn,

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:27.660
I reduce the attack points of Tyrant 
Red Dragon Archfiend by 1100,

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:32.340
and increase those of Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon by the same amount!

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.090
Odd-Eyes's attack points...

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:39.160
...are higher than those of Jack's dragon!

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:42.230
And Yuya has five monsters 
on his side of the field!

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:45.200
I-Is he about to...

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.940
Is King going to lose?

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:49.140
The undisputed champion?

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:52.310
I activate my trap Over the Red!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:55.930
When the attack points of a Red 
Synchro Monster are reduced,

00:03:55.930 --> 00:04:00.010
those attack points are doubled 
until the end of this turn.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:04.090
And I can banish Scarlight 
Red Dragon Archfiend,

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.620
to add its attack points on top of that.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.200
N-No way!

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:17.160
10,000 attack points?!

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:18.700
Wow...

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.210
He's a superstar, on another level.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.210
Jack Atlas is a force to be feared.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:26.810
This is how I... How the king duels!

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:29.380
Now, keep up with me, Yuya Sakaki.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:32.820
Hit me with your duel, with your words,

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:36.190
with the cry of your soul!

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:46.160
Just as Dad, founder of the entertainment 
duel, fought with pride,

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.970
I, as founder of the Pendulum Summon,

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:51.900
will fight with pride in my words!

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:54.870
W-Wait, Yuya!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.820
I activate Nirvana High Paladin's 
Pendulum Effect,

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:00.610
targeting Timebreaker Magician!

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:04.450
This turn, Timebreaker Magician 
cannot be destroyed by battle,

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.580
and battle damage to me is reduced to 0!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:08.810
Go, Timebreaker Magician...

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:11.560
Attack Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:12.490
Wait a minute.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:14.200
Even if it can't be destroyed,

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:18.530
why use a monster with 2000 attack points 
against an opponent with 10,000?

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.700
When a monster targeted by Nirvana High 
Paladin's Pendulum Effect attacks,

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:31.740
after battle, the attack points of all monsters 
on your field decrease by its attack points!

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.150
Its attack points decreased by 2000!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:40.850
But that won't be enough to faze Jack...

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:48.290
Is this your cry? It hasn't resonated 
with my soul, not even one bit.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:51.130
Even if each voice by itself is small,

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:55.270
everyone's voices together will 
resonate with your soul!

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:57.360
That's right, Yuya!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:58.240
Crow?

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:02.710
Right now, everyone in City 
is focused on this duel.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:06.710
You're the only one whose words 
can get through now!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.520
After everything that's happened, 
I'm betting on you.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.220
Give it all you've got, Yuya.

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:15.620
Crow... Shinji...

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:20.390
The fun is only getting started!

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:25.900
After Nirvana High Paladin's current 
target battles, its Pendulum Effect

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.950
can transfer targets to a monster 
of one level more.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:34.360
I change my target from Level 3 Timebreaker 
Magician to Level 4 Radish Horse.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.810
Go, Radish Horse!

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:39.780
Attack Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:44.650
He shaved it down again!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:47.920
Now it's down by Radish Horse's 
attack points! 1100!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:56.480
Yuya Sakaki, who defeated me, 
is now dueling the king?

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.280
That's great!

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:02.870
Hey, guys! Let's race forward, with all 
our hearts, like those duelists!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.280
After battle ends,

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:13.110
Nirvana High Paladin's Pendulum Effect 
transfers to Level 5 Gumgumouton!

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:17.560
It's like the monsters are all holding hands...

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.650
Yeah.

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:22.820
Go, Gumgumouton...

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.120
Attack Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.750
It's shaved down again!

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.530
Tyrant is down to 5400 attack points.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:34.970
I get it...

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:41.290
He summoned five monsters, 
all one level apart, to the field,

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:44.560
so he could keep using Nirvana 
High Paladin's effect.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.650
Great one, Yuya! I don't like it, 
but you're doing great.

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:51.620
As reward, I'll give this a name. I call it...

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.510
Straight Pendulum!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:01.190
Next, Level 6 Bubblebowwow!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.730
Go... Attack Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:12.200
Tyrant's attack points decrease another 2500!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.420
That's hot!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.340
Both of you, fight hard!

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:18.680
What's going on here?

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.050
What is this?

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:26.520
The D-Wheels, cars, helicopters, the monorail...

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.520
They're all coming together to watch the duel!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:34.070
Are you sure you should be out, 
with martial law in place?

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.860
The greatest duel in all of City 
is currently taking place.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:44.740
As a member of City, it would 
be a crime to not be part of it.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.460
I see! Is that it?

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.440
Are these your words, Yuya Sakaki?

00:08:55.690 --> 00:09:01.290
Each voice is small. But together, 
they can create great resonance.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:07.440
Has your hope, the feelings you believe 
in, reached all of City, then?

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.530
Amazing... This is amazing!

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.900
It's a huge rally throughout all City.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.630
I've never seen anything like it!

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.340
Bring it, Yuya!

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:20.430
See your duel through to the end.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.840
I'll oppose it with everything I have!

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:25.110
Thank you, King.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:31.180
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:35.540
Now, everyone...

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.620
It's time for the climax, at last!

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:42.090
The attacks of monsters, Levels 3 to 6, 
have finished, so the last one is...

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:43.800
Level 7!

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:51.470
Yes! The big star, waiting in the wings, 
is Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:55.560
Odd-Eyes's current attack points are 4200.

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:59.850
If it battles Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend, 
whose attack is lowered,

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:02.310
it could destroy the monster, but...

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:05.850
It wouldn't take out the last of Jack's life.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:09.020
After all that, he wouldn't stop there.

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:11.340
That boy has it...

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:16.230
There's no fooling the sharp-eyed 
promoter Gallagher.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.930
Go, Yuya!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.200
We're waiting!

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:28.110
Yuya! Yuya! Yuya! Yuya!

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:35.080
Look! All the feelings, all City's hopes, 
are focused on Yuya Sakaki!

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.240
"D-Wheels are symbols of hope."

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:43.220
That's what Crow once said.

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:48.980
That D-Wheels symbolized hope, standing for 
the freedom the Commons searched for.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:52.400
Right now, all of City is united by Yuya's duel.

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:57.040
Now, everyone! Say it with me, one last time!

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:58.740
Go! Battle!

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.710
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.910
attacks Tyrant Red Dragon

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.880
Archfiend!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:09.510
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.820
In that instant, Odd-Eyes's effect activates!

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:16.790
When it does battle with a 
monster, Level 5 or above,

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:20.260
it deals double the damage to the opponent!

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:23.400
Reaction Force!

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:37.160
The winner is Yuya Sakaki!

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:41.760
Shining, as the king of the Friendship 
Cup, at only 14 years old...

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.720
A new star of hope, wielding entertainment 
duels and the Pendulum Summon...

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.890
Yuya Sakaki!

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:55.290
Yuya! Yuya! Yuya! Yuya!

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.780
Yeah!

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:07.340
Yuya! Yuya! Yuya! Yuya!

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:09.210
Yuya!

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:15.780
Yuya! Yuya! Yuya! Yuya!

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.070
Thanks, King.

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:39.040
I am no longer the king!

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.100
S-Sorry, Jack...

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.430
The one who has conquered 
the Friendship Cup,

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:48.110
becoming the new King of 
Duelists, is you, Yuya.

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:50.550
Using duels to bring smiles...

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:55.990
Is this the power of your 
beliefs, of Smile World?

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:58.810
No, it isn't my power alone.

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:00.850
It's because I was able to fight you...

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:02.960
because it was a duel with Jack Atlas...

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:05.600
that it made City's people smile this much!

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:09.450
Attention, residents of City!

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:12.760
I have never been so happy.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:16.460
Yuya Sakaki here is the duelist 
I have been searching for.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:19.140
A true duelist with whom I can 
communicate, through duels.

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:23.720
I am proud that I was able 
to fight this man today!

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:34.460
In the skies above City, still excited 
by Yuya Sakaki's victory,

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:35.990
what is this helicopter?

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.160
That's...

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.570
the Administrative Council!

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:44.300
What do the town's head honchos want here?

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.730
Attention, residents of City.

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:50.350
Now that all Friendship Cup 
matches are finished,

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:56.010
we of the Administrative Council have 
a confession to make to you.

00:13:56.380 --> 00:14:01.360
While proclaiming harmony 
between Tops and Commons,

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:06.490
the Friendship Cup was really a competition 
to choose the strongest duelist, the king.

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:09.870
We believed using that king as a symbol

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.730
would maintain balance between 
Tops and Commons,

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:16.970
and preserve our society in its current form.

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:21.810
In other words, as far as we were concerned, 
the king could be anyone...

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:28.210
...as long as it was someone without ambition, 
who would not try to overthrow us.

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:29.680
Roget...

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:32.650
But through this year's competition,

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:39.660
we were forced to see that this thinking is 
old-fashioned, underhanded, and cowardly.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:44.890
And then, Jack and Yuya Sakaki showed us

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:48.400
a new way that City could be...

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.180
A city without Tops or Commons,

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:54.400
where everyone can work together, 
without walls separating them,

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:57.010
and live together with smiles.

00:14:57.430 --> 00:15:02.400
We, the Administrative Council, hereby disband,

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:08.310
entrusting City's future to the younger generation.

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:14.230
I'd like anyone who agrees with this 
proposal to indicate it by applause.

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:23.440
Incredible... What a moving scene.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:27.020
In this moment, there are no 
Tops or Commons here!

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:30.570
City really is united as one! We're all friends!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:37.110
Getting to preside over this historic 
moment... I really am popular!

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:45.980
Are you certain about this?

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:50.460
There are still a number 
of unresolved problems.

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:51.480
Yes.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:56.080
We have yet to decide the Synchro Dimension's 
stance in the interdimensional war.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:16:00.950
That is something that everyone in City 
should decide for themselves.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.940
Isn't that right, chairman?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.000
Yes.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.520
That decision carries responsibility with it.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:10.600
From now on, the citizens can 
carry their own responsibilities,

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:13.450
and make their own decisions for their future.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.460
No matter what that future might be.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:21.950
Yuya, I believe your fight is not over yet.

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.640
Yeah, there's still Yuzu—

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:26.200
Roget ran away with Yuzu!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.300
What?

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.320
Roget...

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:29.770
...took Yuzu?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:34.370
Tsukikage and I rescued Yuzu from her cell.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.040
Then Roget appeared and...

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:39.210
He defeated them in a duel?

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:43.900
He's taking Yuzu to Academia...

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:46.450
You... You have to stop him!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:48.320
Sora!

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:55.290
Yuya Sakaki, we will take you to 
the Public Order Bureau.

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:56.710
Get on board!

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.240
It's no use! The elevators are down!

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:04.750
Evacuate via the emergency stairways!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:10.410
This is awful. You stopped the other 
elevators, so you could escape?

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:14.880
True winners do not feel pity for the losers.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.610
That is the road to being a winner.

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:20.580
No, you aren't a winner. You've already lost!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.450
What did you say?!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:27.890
Have not the allies who came to save you 
already been defeated by my hand?

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.630
But Yuya won!

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:31.620
He won and united City.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:34.440
That's why you have to run, isn't it?

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:39.210
You gave up on City, and you're running, 
tail between your legs, back to Academia.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:40.200
Shut up!

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:42.830
I am not running...

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:47.410
I am temporarily withdrawing to recoup 
my strength. It's strategy!

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:51.880
Oh? So going back with Yuzu 
Hiiragi is a strategy?

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:52.750
What?

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:55.850
It looks like mere self-preservation to me.

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:58.320
Reiji Akaba...

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:01.430
From the start, that's what the 
hostages were for, right?

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:04.920
When you decided to break off from Academia,

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:08.640
you needed her as a bargaining chip.

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:10.800
Just in case you had to return,

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:18.040
you could offer her up, clear your name 
of treason, and protect yourself.

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:23.050
Before you even fought, the moment 
you considered your excuses...

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.320
You were already beaten.

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.260
Now, give her up peacefully,

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:32.100
and beg forgiveness from City's people.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:39.260
As head of the Public Order Bureau, take 
responsibility for plunging City into chaos!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.750
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:43.020
I won't beg forgiveness!

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.240
I haven't lost!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.440
Tsukikage?

00:18:58.800 --> 00:18:59.720
Brother!

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:04.730
Brother! Brother!

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.230
Calm yourself, Master Layra.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:11.200
Master Reiji did not wish to 
see you in harm's way.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.400
Harm's way?

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:15.920
Yes. Roget is a truly fearsome opponent.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.170
You cannot begin to imagine 
the duel he will bring.

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:20.310
Cannot imagine?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.440
"Beg forgiveness," you said?

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:33.500
How dare you say such a 
humiliating thing to me?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:38.390
I shall ask you to do the same.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.920
If you ask now, I am willing to consider it.

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:47.830
Earn my forgiveness, and come 
with me to Academia.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.800
To Academia?

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:54.960
Yes, if I bring not only Yuzu 
Hiiragi, but also you,

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.930
the Professor will be truly pleased!

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:02.780
"Thank you for capturing my 
prodigal son," he'll say...

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:04.650
Nonsense.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.760
When I go to Academia,

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:11.390
it will be to face it, head-on, and destroy it.

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:15.090
Then face and destroy me, as well!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:16.730
Very well.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.940
Field Spell Crossover.

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:27.400
Duel!

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:30.610
I shall take the first move.

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.540
I activate my spell card Polymerization,

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:37.540
and fuse two Ancient Gear Soldiers!

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:42.670
Mechanical soldiers, inheriting souls of antiquity,

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:47.730
form ranks, merge, and be 
reborn with new power!

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:49.430
Fusion Summon!

00:20:53.300 --> 00:21:02.840
Appear, Level 8 Ancient Gear Howitzer!

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:10.050
And I activate Equip Spell Ancient 
Gear Magic Shield from my hand,

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:12.050
and equip it to Ancient Gear Howitzer!

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:15.740
Thus, Gear Howitzer cannot 
be destroyed by battle,

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:18.790
and its defense points increase by 1200.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:22.520
Then, I activate Ancient Gear 
Howitzer's monster effect!

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:26.240
Once per turn, I can destroy one 
spell card on my side of the field

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:30.040
to deal 1000 points of damage to you!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.830
When equipped with Magic Shield, Gear Howitzer

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:40.760
is unaffected by your card effects, and it 
cannot be destroyed by battle.

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:44.980
In addition, each turn, it deals 
1000 points of damage to you!

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:48.620
Can you defeat my invincible combo?

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:51.680
I end my turn!

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:54.730
Now, come at me, Reiji Akaba!

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.440
Wait for me, Yuzu...

00:22:06.440 --> 00:22:08.360
I'm coming to save you now!

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:51.550
This duel will never end.

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:53.280
Not until, exhausted and in pain,

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:57.650
you cry that you can fight no 
more, and beg forgiveness!

00:23:57.650 --> 00:24:00.730
This is the path to absolute victory!

00:24:00.730 --> 00:24:05.030
There's no absolute in business, 
nor in duels.

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:09.790
No matter how carefully you hedge your 
risk, cracks will always appear.

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:13.500
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Eternal Duel.

00:24:14.100 --> 00:24:17.220
The fun is only getting started!
